Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:08:59.99,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Attention all crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:05.08,Announcement,,0,0,0,,The Captain's illness has left him unable to fulfill his duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:13.76,Announcement,,0,0,0,,By his order, command of the ship is hereby transferred to Lieutenant Daisuke Shima.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:19.22,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Repeat, as of this moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:22.39,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Command of the ship is hereby transferred to Lieutenant Daisuke Shima.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.64,0:01:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.97,0:01:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.23,0:01:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you certain you want to trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.82,0:01:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They got us here, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.25,0:02:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He's recovering from his surgery fine. It's just overwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs some rest. Don't allow him to overwork himself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.10,0:02:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.39,0:02:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about the Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. He's immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.94,0:02:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.19,0:02:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we just need to find more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.02,0:02:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.57,0:02:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.82,0:02:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The fourth planet in the Beemela system, Beemela-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.87,0:02:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it has plenty of water. There's oxygen, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.66,0:02:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as there's nothing dangerous down there, resupplying will be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.75,0:02:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We might as well live there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Shima, prepare to land on Beemela-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.64,0:03:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.98,0:03:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai, form a landing party, and then take the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Inputting landing coordinates. Latitude, North 37 degrees. Longitude, East 138 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No harmful chemicals in the atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:03:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to use this as a second Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.69,0:03:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We've reached our position in the atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to launch the Seagull.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Launching Seagull.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Seagull has launched.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato will hold position in atmosphere, at 1,500 meters,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and await report from the Seagull.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.97,0:04:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Misaki, are you not feeling well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Airsick?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.39,0:04:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.39,0:04:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just, lately, there have been times I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.77,0:04:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound "all right" to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.57,0:04:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Metal detected at one o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a look at it. Prepare for descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Niimi, you are a talented analyst.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.47,0:05:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And I respect you as one of my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.98,0:05:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your plan for humanity to settle on Beemela-4?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.02,0:05:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,For the Yamato to successfully complete its mission will be extremely difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'd go so far as to call it impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.07,0:05:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We can continue warping, there isn't\Nenough time to make it to Iscandar and back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if we reach the Large Magellanic Cloud, we don't know for sure where Iscandar is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.21,0:05:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's a possibility that Beemela could be a new home for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.47,0:05:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We should return to Earth and prepare to move humanity here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I said enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.76,0:05:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take this information to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.89,0:05:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir... Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.98,0:06:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.78,0:06:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A splendid speech. But it seems\Nyou've failed to win the XO's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your actions here almost amount to treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.79,0:06:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Security Officer, arrest Niimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, just doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.64,0:06:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing... I didn't know you had that kind of equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a superior unit, able to handle any mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.07,0:06:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.45,0:06:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay with the Seagull.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Misaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.21,0:07:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? We'll leave you behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.97,0:07:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Analyzer, how far to that metal you were talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Approximately three kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone... Someone is watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You apprehended the XO?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just going to go through with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:07:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your decision, Shima...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.17,0:08:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The XO is late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true. He's usually very punctual.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.26,0:08:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shima?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No luck here, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.76,0:09:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.93,0:09:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these all the pilots on standby?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.64,0:09:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't say... Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.52,0:09:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.77,0:09:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, search for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No one was in the shower room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:10:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Navigation Officer Shima.\NI am temporarily in command of this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.47,0:10:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Our investigation has revealed that the planet we're currently on,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.69,0:10:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Beemela-4, is suitable for human habitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.15,0:10:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,At present, the Yamato is far behind schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.15,0:10:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, after discussion with the XO,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.12,0:10:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have decided to suspend the Yamato Plan, which only offers a slim chance for
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,return before humanity's destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, we will return to Earth,\Nwith information about this habitable planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.25,0:10:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.13,0:10:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as we have resupplied, we'll leave Beemela-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.80,0:10:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This decision was made with Captain Okita's agreement, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.35,0:10:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,To avoid unnecessary confusion,\Nall crew is to obey the security staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.82,0:10:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Let's go talk to Shima and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.32,0:10:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.37,0:11:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yabu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.71,0:11:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.17,0:11:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't have you leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.63,0:11:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate bugs! I hate bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Analyzer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Misaki, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Mr. Bug?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.67,0:11:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bug? Mr. Bug?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.09,0:12:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.51,0:12:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.93,0:12:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.29,0:12:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The engine room is under control, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The old men wield a lot of influence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, Navigation Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.05,0:12:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.47,0:12:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.60,0:12:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we're back on Earth, I'll tell everyone{\fscx75}—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.27,0:12:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I said shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to go home that much, alien girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.06,0:12:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.98,0:13:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what I said. She isn't from Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A year ago, didn't an Iscandarian bring us the Wave Motion Engine plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and all they told us was her name, not what became of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yurisha Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.42,0:13:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where do you think she went?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.05,0:13:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a rumor that she died in an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.93,0:13:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's still alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's right here. She's been here the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.27,0:13:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.99,0:13:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.62,0:13:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But this isn't from Earth, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:13:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it from this planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like the Iscandarian ship I saw on Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it does. This is an Iscandarian ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.97,0:14:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No life signs detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.85,0:14:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Approximately four hundred years have passed since it crashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that big bug afraid of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.77,0:14:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A long, long time ago... Iscandar came.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.90,0:14:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Its task was salvation...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The salvation of all intelligent life in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the path of Iscandar, and the task of our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My beautiful Yurisha, my sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You will fulfill that task.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.17,0:14:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring hope to the people of Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and the courage to make that hope reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.64,0:14:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trial, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:15:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The salvation of all intelligent life in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the path of Iscandar...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.44,0:15:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're saying there's intelligent life here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a long time ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.24,0:15:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Misaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're acting strangely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this hairstyle's weird, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tactical Officer, I'm detecting another metallic signal up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us a trial, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What does she think we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, Iscandar is no different than Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.15,0:15:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Misaki's intuition was right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.03,0:15:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.66,0:15:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that civilization on this planet has collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I estimate the time of its destruction as 330 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.55,0:16:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,These are Beemelarians?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.01,0:16:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.59,0:16:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks like that big insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.51,0:16:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely, a feral version of their livestock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.82,0:16:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a Wave Motion Core!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.21,0:16:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Navigation Officer, let's prepare to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But Kodai and the others haven't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.55,0:16:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer to avoid unnecessary bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.43,0:16:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I'm trying to say, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:16:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll prepare to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.73,0:17:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Sado?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Ito's little boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.03,0:17:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm closed for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.99,0:17:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.57,0:17:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we can't reach the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here. They aren't coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Get ready to pick us up. Transmitting rendezvous point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.17,0:17:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Tactical Officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.09,0:17:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There is some video data available.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.76,0:17:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you display it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.09,0:17:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.93,0:17:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.58,0:17:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You will stay here until the ship's chain of command is reestablished.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.94,0:17:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm from Iscandar?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:18:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about what Ito said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.97,0:18:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamamoto! What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We should inform the landing party.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.97,0:18:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they've locked all communications down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.81,0:18:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.02,0:18:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.65,0:18:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One place we can communicate from.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Hoshina.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way! It's time for the Captain's checkup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.29,0:18:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told to admit no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I have permission from Ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tactical Officer, the Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.18,0:19:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Start an approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Seagull, can you hear me? This is the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... I'd forgotten about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.43,0:19:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Seagull, come in. This is the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Seagull.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.77,0:19:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do with the Captain and XO?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,XO Sanada was murdered by a group that\Ndesired to continue the journey to Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.37,0:19:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And Okita will never recover from his ill{\fscx75}—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.21,0:19:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.92,0:19:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito, there's trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hangar 3 on the port side is opening!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand by for guidance beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.88,0:19:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.47,0:19:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The landing party is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.55,0:19:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to allow them to board.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just going to leave them here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.89,0:19:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Navigation Officer, please shut the hangar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.31,0:19:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No more victims{\fscx75}—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.14,0:19:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Navigation Officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.94,0:19:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I am in command here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.98,0:20:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a problem... I have to insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.74,0:20:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.07,0:20:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That is unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.20,0:20:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It is very unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.75,0:20:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put an end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.21,0:20:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why I hate women!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.27,0:20:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoshina...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.90,0:20:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.36,0:20:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.61,0:20:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You betrayed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.74,0:20:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.83,0:20:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You were just on the wrong side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.75,0:20:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you pull any coup d'état while I'm around!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.14,0:21:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.64,0:21:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mori?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.65,0:21:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe, Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.27,0:21:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.16,0:21:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So you work for Director Todo, of Strategic Planning, Division 6?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,By his order, I was investigating the Izumo Plan backers that had infiltrated the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.84,0:21:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.46,0:21:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't prevent their mutiny from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.97,0:21:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was thanks to Navigation Officer Shima
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.51,0:21:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,that I was able to prevent any bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.97,0:21:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm responsible for this, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.79,0:21:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the reasons this happened is\Nbecause we've fallen behind schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be no further need for concern on that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.53,0:22:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If the information Kodai found on Beemela is accurate,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.16,0:22:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,we can more than make up the lost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.83,0:22:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if we hadn't stopped at Beemela, we would've never found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.87,0:22:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible that all of this was a trial the Iscandarians set for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.20,0:24:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The ancient gate:
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.68,0:24:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,a bridge between the stars that hangs suspended in the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.62,0:24:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai and his team infiltrate a control satellite to activate the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.00,0:24:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There, they hear a story of the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.21,0:24:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and the door to that time will now be opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.51,0:24:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: Out of the Forest of Memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.72,0:24:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 275 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:29.54,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\pos(1312,840)}Episode 16{\fad(1850,1500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:29.54,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\pos(1204,1073)}A Choice for the Future{\fad(1850,1500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:29.41,tsing 3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1553,344)\bord0\blur0.75\frx342\fry38\fs42\frz46.51}Crime{\fax0.1} and{\fax0.15} Punishment{\fad(0,2150)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.36,0:22:29.41,tsing 3,,0,0,0,,{\an5\org(6,446)\frz46.51\pos(234,452)\bord0\blur0.75\frx342\fry38\fs42}Crime{\fax0.1} and{\fax0.15} Punishment{\fad(0,2150)}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.55,0:09:00.47,tsing 4,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\pos(524.571,374.142)\frz17.71}{\b4.5}Do not use
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.55,0:09:00.47,tsing 4,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\pos(588.001,619.286)\frz17.71}{\b4.5}under repairs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:22.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.13,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:30.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:35.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:44.36,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:51.91,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:01:00.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:05.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:16.18,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.55,0:22:54.23,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}No matter how steep or far the road is
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:58.52,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I will not give up
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.69,0:23:07.37,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Endless tears flowing down my cheek are not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.37,0:23:12.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}A white flag of surrender
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.66,0:23:24.38,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}I go and become the wings of a loved one
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.47,0:23:28.76,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}Gather up the shattered dream
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.76,0:23:34.39,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}And take it to the end of the universe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.39,0:23:37.35,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.35,0:23:39.86,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Row strongly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:46.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}And hold your thoughts close to your chest
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.57,0:23:50.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.45,0:23:54.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Through your despair
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.29,0:24:02.55,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1000)}A ray of light shines
